/-!
# Generator certificates for the two distinguished Held entries

All 45 representatives are generated by their displayed seven elements,
including the two defined using the shared exceptional subgroup and the whole
Sylow group. Positive word certificates cover every relevant element of the
already verified Sylow enumeration. Each word equation compares actual
permutations and is proved by kernel reduction.

The source generator is `source/generate_generators.py`. This is preparatory
finite mathematics for Huppert--Blackburn III, XII.1.18(b), printed p.314.
It asserts no subgroup census or automorphism property.
-/

